# Contact form relay. Get a key at https://web3forms.com — it is issued against
# the address the mail lands at (jamesgathuru001@gmail.com), no account needed.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill it in. `.env.local` is gitignored;
# `.env.example` is the checked-in record of which vars a build needs.
#
# This key is NOT a secret. Anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the client
# bundle by design, and Web3Forms keys are meant to be public. Lock it to the
# domain in the Web3Forms dashboard — that, not secrecy, is what stops someone
# pointing their own form at your inbox.
#
# Without it the Contact section degrades to a plain mailto link rather than
# rendering a form that would fail on submit.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=9185cb01-cef3-4eb0-b70d-818c6bda640b
